{
  "id": "1SA.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Sam 16",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kuSamuweli: Koze kube nini umkhalela uSawuli lokhu mina ngimlahlile ukuba angabe esaba yinkosi koIsrayeli na? Gcwalisa uphondo lwakho ngamafutha, uhambe; ngizakukuthuma kuJese waseBetlehema, ngoba ngizibonele inkosi emadodaneni akhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wathi: Ngizahamba njani na? Uba uSawuli ekuzwa lokho, uzangibulala. INkosi yasisithi: Hamba lethokazi uthi: Ngizehlabela iNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umeme uJese ukuba eze emhlatshelweni, ngizakukutshengisa lokho ozakwenza; uzangigcobela lowo engizakukutshengisa yena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasesenza lokho iNkosi emtshele khona, waya eBetlehema. Abadala bomuzi bamhlangabeza bethuthumela bathi: Uze ngokuthula na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi: Yebo, ngize ngokuthula; ngize ukuhlabela iNkosi; zihlambululeni, lihambe lami ekuhlabeni. Wasehlambulula uJese lamadodana akhe, labo wabamema ukuba beze ekuhlabeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi sebefikile, wakhangela uEliyabi wathi: Impela nguye lo ogcotshiweyo weNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa iNkosi yathi kuSamuweli: Ungakhangeli isimo sakhe lobude bakhe, ngoba ngimalile. INkosi kayibonisi okomuntu; umuntu ubona okusemehlweni, kodwa iNkosi ibona okusenhliziyweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJese wasebiza uAbinadaba, wamedlulisa phambi kukaSamuweli, kodwa yena wathi: Layena lo iNkosi kayimkhethanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJese wasedlulisa uShama. Wathi futhi: Layena lo iNkosi kayimkhethanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJese wasedlulisa phambi kukaSamuweli amanye amadodana akhe ayisikhombisa. USamuweli wathi kuJese: Lalaba iNkosi kayibakhethanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasesithi kuJese: Asephelele wonke amadodana akho na? Yena wathi: Kusasele encinyane eyelusa izimvu. USamuweli wathi kuJese: Thumela ilizwi ukuba ibizwe, ngoba kasiyikuhlala phansi aze afike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasethumela ilizwi ukuba ilandwe. Yayibukeka, inhle ilobuso obubomvana lamehlo amahle. INkosi yathi: Sukuma, umgcobe, ngoba nguye lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasethatha uphondo lwamafutha, wamgcoba phakathi kwabafowabo; umoya weNkosi wehlela phezu kukaDavida kusukela kulolosuku kusiya phambili. USamuweli wasuka wabuyela eRama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umoya weNkosi wasuka kuSawuli, lomoya omubi ovela eNkosini wamkhathaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zikaSawuli zathi kuye: Khangela, umoya omubi ovela kuNkulunkulu uyakukhathaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayitsho inkosi yethu ukuba inceku zayo ezikhona lapha zidinge umuntu okwaziyo ukutshaya ichacho, ukuba lapho ufikelwa ngumoya omubi ovela kuNkulunkulu, alitshaye ukuze usile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uSawuli wasesithi encekwini zakhe: Ngidingelani umuntu okwaziyo ukutshaya kuhle, limlethe kimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunye wamajaha waphendula wathi: Ngibona indodana kaJese waseBetlehema, kuyiyo ekwaziyo ukutshaya; futhi iliqhawe elilamandla lehlakaniphileyo ekukhulumeni, lebukekayo; leNkosi ilayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uSawuli wasethumela izithunywa kuJese, wathi: Thumela kimi uDavida indodana yakho owalusa izimvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJese wathatha ubabhemi, wamthwalisa isinkwa lembodlela yewayini, wathatha lezinyane, wakuthumela kuSawuli ngoDavida indodana yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wafika kuSawuli, wamsebenzela. USawuli wamthanda kakhulu, wamenza waba ngumphathi wezikhali zakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasethumela ilizwi kuJese wathi: UDavida uzahlala emsebenzini wami, ngoba uyangithokozisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakusithi lapho umoya omubi ovela kuNkulunkulu umehlela uSawuli, uDavida athathe ichacho atshaye, abeseqaqabuka uSawuli esiba ngcono, lomoya omubi usuke kuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
